{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "And I never would've known if I hadn't\nteamed up with you. Ironic, huh?": "",
  "And I never would've known if I hadn't\nteamed up with you. Talk about irony, huh?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(So Sugiura was still doubting me\neven as we worked together.)</color>": "",
  "Three years later,\nthe real killer's finally clear.": "",
  "Three years later, the real killer's finally clear.": "",
  "And now it turns out... Shono...": "",
  "And now I know... Shono...": "",
  "He's the one leading the charge\nto cure Alzheimer's!": "",
  "He gets to go down\nin history as a hero!?": "",
  "He gets to live out his days loved\nby the whole goddamn world.": "",
  "For what? Stabbing my sister to death!?\nBurning her body!?": "",
  "Emi Terasawa's dead! He stabbed her to death\nand burned her body!": "",
  "Don't worry. Everyone'll see him for who\nhe really is once the truth gets out.": "",
  "Don't worry. Once the truth gets out,\neveryone'll see who he really is.": "",
  "You weren't there today.\nThe whole fucking system is protecting him.": "",
  "No...You weren't there today.\nThe whole fucking system is protecting him.": "",
  "They bent the truth. Suppressed evidence.\nRight in front of me.": "",
  "They bent the truth, and suppressed evidence.\nRight in front of me!": "",
  "What's the point of fighting that\nkinda battle, huh!? It's bullshit!": "",
  "So now what!? We can't fight that kind of battle!\nIt's bullshit!": "",
  "You saw it too, right,\nYagami-san? Right!?": "",
  "You know I'm right!\nYagami-san, you saw it!": "",
  "Look, Sugiura. Ever since Emi-chan died...\nI've been running away from the truth.": "",
  "Look, Sugiura... I've been doing a lot of running.\nEver since Emi-chan died... I've been running from the truth.": "",
  "I was worried. Worried I wasn't gonna like what I found.\nThat maybe I was responsible for her death.": "",
  "I was worried. Wondered if maybe I <font_kind=yakuza_italic>was</font_kind> responsible\nfor her death.": "",
  "It was killing me.\nI couldn't bring myself to face it all.": "",
  "It was killing me. I just couldn't\nbring myself to face that.": "",
  "Tak...": "",
  "If you ask me... everyone has something they're\ntrying to hide from themselves.": "",
  "If you ask me... it's the same for everybody.\nWe all have something we're trying to hide from ourselves.": "",
  "But sometimes facing your fears\nis the only way forward.": "",
  "But sometimes there's only one way forward.\nYou have to face what you fear most.": "",
  "The real reason you came to me is because,\ndeep down, you wanted to know the truth.": "",
  "I think I know the real reason you came to me.\nDeep down in your heart, you wanted to know the truth.": "",
  "If that's still true...\nWe have our work cut out for us.": "",
  "If that's still true...\nwe've got our work cut out for us.": "",
  "We're gonna chase the truth as far\nas we can. Even if it's in vain.": "",
  "No matter what they throw at us,\nin vain or not, we're gonna chase the truth.": "",
  "Yeah but...\nAll our paths are blocked.": "",
  "But all our paths are blocked...": "",
  "Who the hell cares?\nWe'll blaze our own path then.": "",
  "Who the hell cares?\nWe'll cut our own path.": "",
  "Right, Tak?": "",
  "You guys're outta your goddamn minds.": "",
  "Damn, you're both nuts.": "",
  "It's Mafuyu.": "",
  "What's up, Mafuyu?": "",
  "I need to speak with you about Morita.": "",
  "I need to speak with you\nabout Morita.": "",
  "Wait, you're still here in town?": "",
  "Wait... you're still in Kamurocho?": "",
  "Yes. I'm waiting at Tender.": "",
  "Do you think you could come meet me\nhere? I... I think I'm being followed.": "",
  "Just... do you think you could meet me here?\nI... I think I'm being followed.": "",
  "It felt like someone was watching me all the way\nto the bar. I don't believe I'm imagining it.": "",
  "Yes. It felt like someone was watching me\nall the way here. I'm almost certain.": "",
  "More of those bums\nthe Ministry of Health hired?": "",
  "More homeless guys the\nMinistry of Health hired?": "",
  "Or maybe one of the chief prosecutor's men.": "",
  "Could be... or maybe one of the\nchief prosecutor's men.": "",
  "I'm comin' with. Higashi,\nkeep an eye on Sugiura while we're gone.": "",
  "I heard everything. I'm comin' with.\nHigashi, keep an eye on Sugiura.": "",
  "Huh? Why do...\nAw, fine.": "",
  "Huh? Wh— Hey!": "",
  "Thanks for coming.": "",
  "How did it look outside?\nDid you see anyone suspicious?": "",
  "Not particularly.\nSeemed fine to me.": "",
  "Mind if I sit?": "",
  "What happened to your face?": "",
  "Oh... What happened to your face?": "",
  "What, this?\nIt's nothing.": "",
  "Eh, it's nothing.": "",
  "You said you wanted to talk\nto me about Morita?": "",
  "You said you wanted to talk about Morita?\nWe talking about that here?": "",
  "Yes. Specifically about\nhow he acted tonight.": "",
  "Yes. Specifically about how\nhe acted tonight.": "",
  "It's hard to imagine the Morita I know doing that.\nIt's almost like he's a different person.": "",
  "It's hard to imagine the Morita I know doing that.\nIt's not like him.": "",
  "Almost like... he cared more about\npolitics than the law.": "",
  "As though... he cared more about\npolitics than the law.": "",
  "Not surprising. He's right\nin the middle of this AD-9 mess.": "",
  "Yeah. He's right in the middle of\nthis AD-9 mess.": "",
  "The thing is... Morita is the reason\nI decided to become a prosecutor.": "",
  "The thing is... he's the reason\nI decided to become a prosecutor.": "",
  "When my mother was killed in a hit-and-run,\nhe was there to give me courage. Show me a way forward.": "",
  "When my mom was killed in a hit-and-run,\nhe was there to give me courage. Show me a way forward.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Right, Morita was Mafuyu's first love...)</color>": "",
  "I've heard.": "",
  "That said... As for why he has\nan interest in protecting AD-9...": "",
  "So... as for why he'd be\nprotecting AD-9...": "",
  "I... might have an idea.": "",
  "About ten years ago...\nsomething happened to his family.": "",
  "About ten years ago... something happened\nto his family.": "",
  "Perhaps that's what changed him.\nMade him look the other way on this.": "",
  "Perhaps...\nthe aftermath of that really changed him.": "",
  "What happened?": "",
  "Hold on. I'm not entirely sure my theory is correct.\nIt wouldn't be fair if I misrepresented the facts.": "",
  "Hold on. I'm not even sure my theory is correct.\nIt wouldn't be fair if I misrepresented the facts.": "",
  "However, I just spoke to a former police\ndetective who handled that case.": "",
  "However... I just spoke to a former police detective.\nThe one who handled that case.": "",
  "I'm about to get\nthe case file from him.": "",
  "I'm about to get the case file from him.": "",
  "Where?": "",
  "We're meeting at the Children's Park.": "",
  "The Children's Park in Kamurocho.": "",
  "But it felt like I was being followed...\nSo I didn't want to go alone.": "",
  "But it felt like I was being followed...\nso I didn't want to go alone.": "",
  "So that's our job here?\nWe're your bodyguards?": "",
  "Yes, at least, that was the plan.\nBut seeing what already happened to you...": "",
  "Yes. At least, that was the plan.\nBut seeing you like this...": "",
  "You think a couple o' scratches are gonna\nslow me down? We'll do it! Right, Tak?": "",
  "You think a couple scratches can slow me down?\nWe'll do it! Right, Tak?": "",
  "If you let us see the case file.\nWhat do you say to that?": "",
  "We'll help out, if we can get\na look at that case file.": "",
  "It's a deal then.\nWe'll be your escorts.": "",
  "All right.\nThen you've got an escort.": "",
  "That's cold. Extorting the poor girl?\nGuess chivalry's dead, Mafuyu-chan.": "",
  "Hey, come on. You're extorting her now?\nGuess chivalry's dead, Mafuyu-chan.": "",
  "Are you ready?\nThe detective is waiting for us.": "",
  "Ready to escort me?\nThe detective is waiting for us.": "",
  "Well? Do you see anyone?": "",
  "There. Guess you were right\non the money, Mafuyu-chan.": "",
  "There. Guess you've got\na nose for this, Mafuyu-chan.": "",
  "Looks like they wanna fight, too.": "",
  "Looks like they mean business.": "",
  "Yup. Those aren't\n\"let's chat over some coffee\" faces.": "",
  "Yup. No need to get so close\nif they're just watchin'.": "",
  "So what, are they gonna follow us\nthe whole way like that?": "",
  "This how it's gonna be\nall the way to the park?": "",
  "What should we do?": "",
  "I... What should we do?": "",
  "You back off a bit.\nWe'll take care of 'em.": "",
  "Hang back a bit.\nWe'll take care of 'em.": "",
  "Let's go, Kaito-san!": "",
  "We're going the wrong way.": "",
  "This isn't the right way.": "",
  "There's a shorter route!": "",
  "We should take a more direct route.": "",
  "Back off!": "",
  "Get away from me!": "",
  "Stay back!": "",
  "Stop it!": "",
  "Get him, Yagami-kun!": "",
  "Good job, Yagami-kun!": "",
  "Yagami-kun! Now!": "",
  "Thanks!": "",
  "Hang in there, Yagami-kun!": "",
  "Yagami-kun, hang in there!": "",
  "I'm okay!": "",
  "Yeah!": "",
  "Are you okay, Yagami-kun!?": "",
  "Yagami-kun, are you okay!?": "",
  "What, you worried about me?": "",
  "Fine, forget I asked!": "",
  "Heh, I can keep going!": "",
  "Let's keep going.": "",
  "Let's continue.": "",
  "You're so strong!": "",
  "I think that's all of them.": "",
  "Don't overdo it, Yagami-kun.": "",
  "Don't overdo it...": "",
  "We're almost to the park, guys.": "",
  "Keep it together. Almost there.": "",
  "You're doing great so far.": "",
  "You can do this.": "",
  "Don't worry about me, Yagami-kun.\nI'm fine.": "",
  "Don't worry about me.\nI'm fine.": "",
  "I'm not feeling so good...": "",
  "More of them?": "",
  "Why won't they stop!?": "",
  "They just won't stop!": "",
  "Get out of our way!": "",
  "Get out of my way!": "",
  "We were so close...!": "",
  "This is the place.\nHe should already be here...": "",
  "You said he's an ex-detective, right?": "",
  "You said he's an ex-detective?": "",
  "Uzawa-san, yes?": "",
  "Yup, that's me.": "",
  "Yup. That's me.": "",
  "Uhh...": "",
  "You're the detective from before!": "",
  "You're that detective!": "",
  "Oh shit! Yagami!": "",
  "You're from Yagami Detective Agency!": "",
  "You used to be on the force!?\nHow'd you end up so scruffy?": "",
  "You used to be on the force!?\nHow'd you end up so scruffy-looking?": "",
  "I could ask you the same thing!": "",
  "You two... know each other?": "",
  "You two know each other?": "",
  "Why'd you bring these\nchowderheads along?": "",
  "Prosecutor, why'd you bring\nthese clowns along...?": "",
  "Well, Yagami-kun, he's...": "",
  "He's sort of my boyfriend...": "",
  "Wha!? Since when!?": "",
  "It's not like that!": "",
  "Then why are you blushing!?": "",
  "Someone's blushing!": "",
  "It's comedy hour over here...": "",
  "What a goddamn circus...": "",
  "So? What do we have on the case?": "",
  "So? What can you tell us?": "",
  "Ten years ago, Chief Prosecutor Morita's\nolder brother... strangled their mom to death.": "",
  "Ten years ago, Chief Prosecutor Morita's older brother...\nstrangled their mom to death.": "",
  "A caretaker murder...": "",
  "It was a caretaker murder.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(His brother murdered his own mother?)</color>": "",
  "Their mother was over 70 at the time...\nafflicted with a severe case of Alzheimer's.": "",
  "And they were taking care of her.": "",
  "...And they were taking care of her.": "",
  "Yeah. It's hard to say what a dementia patient'll do\nif you take your eye off 'em even for a second.": "",
  "Yup. It's hard to say what a dementia patient'll do\nif you take your eye off them for even a second.": "",
  "She apparently used to leave the stove on after she cooked.\nOr wander out in the middle of the night.": "",
  "She apparently used to leave the stove on.\nOr wander out in the middle of the night.": "",
  "None of the homes had any\nopenings for her, either.": "",
  "Ultimately, Morita's brother took care\nof their mom by himself.": "",
  "Ultimately, Morita's brother took care of\ntheir mom by himself.": "",
  "It seems he put the burden\nentirely on his own back.": "",
  "He quit his job and moved in with their mother, all to ensure\nMorita was free to do his duty as chief prosecutor.": "",
  "He quit his job and moved in with their mother,\nall to ensure Morita was free to work as chief prosecutor.": "",
  "He barely took breaks, barely slept.\nFor seven whole years before the incident.": "",
  "All he got from his mother in return was abuse.\nVerbal... and sometimes physical.": "",
  "But in return, all he got was abuse.\nWasn't always just verbal, either. Sometimes physical.": "",
  "The hell'd she do that for...?": "",
  "It's a side effect of dementia,\nthough not all patients exhibit it.": "",
  "Some cases can be suppressed,\nbut it doesn't always work out.": "",
  "At the time of the incident, Morita's brother\nwas in the midst of a serious mental breakdown.": "",
  "At the time of the incident, Morita's brother\nwas having a serious mental breakdown.": "",
  "If I had to guess,\nhe'd probably been about to break for months...": "",
  "Honestly, he'd probably already reached\nhis limit months earlier.": "",
  "And the result...\nwas him murdering his own mother.": "",
  "And so, under all that weight...\nhe snapped.": "",
  "What ever became of him?\nAfter all that.": "",
  "What then? What'd he do after\nhe killed her?": "",
  "Well... not long afterward,\nhe tried to hang himself and failed.": "",
  "Well... not long after, he tried and failed\nto hang himself.": "",
  "So they suspended his sentence\nuntil he was more stable.": "",
  "He was too unstable to be sentenced...": "",
  "And where is he now?": "",
  "So, where is he now?": "",
  "It says here he died a year later,\nby his own hand.": "",
  "...Well, it says here he died a year later,\nby his own hand.": "",
  "Dude...": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(His own brother killed his ailing mother\nand then committed suicide on top of that.)</color>": "",
  "After everything his brother did, Morita was removed\nfrom the spotlight for a while.": "",
  "After everything his brother did, Morita was\nremoved from the spotlight for a while.": "",
  "But it seems that's\nall in the past now.": "",
  "But it seems that's all\nin the past now.": "",
  "Everyone recognizes him as an\nunquestionable leader on the force.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Thanks for coming.": "ขอบคุณที่แวะมานะคะ",
  "Mind if I sit?": "ขอนั่งด้วยได้ไหม?",
  "Eh, it's nothing.": "เอ่อ ไม่มีอะไรหรอก",
  "I've heard.": "ได้ยินแล้ว",
  "What happened?": "เกิดอะไรขึ้นเหรอ?",
  "Where?": "ที่ไหน?",
  "What should we do?": "เราจะทำยังไงกับมันดีครับ?",
  "Back off!": "ถอยไป!",
  "Get away from me!": "อยู่ให้ห่างจากฉันไป!",
  "Stay back!": "ถอยไป!",
  "Stop it!": "หยุดนะ!",
  "Thanks!": "ขอบคุณ!",
  "Yeah!": "ใช่เลย!",
  "Let's keep going.": "ไปต่อกันเถอะ",
  "You can do this.": "ทำได้อยู่แล้วน่า",
  "Get out of my way!": "หลีกไปให้พ้นทาง!",
  "Uhh...": "เอ่อ...",
  "And where is he now?": "แล้วตอนนี้เขาอยู่ที่ไหน?"
 }
}
